Package: Taxis
Title: Temporal Association eXploration for Clinical Inference Studies (TAXIS) Concept AB Mining Engine
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gowtham", "Rao", email = "gowtham.rao@coreason.ai", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Stephen", "Bandeian", email = "sbandeian@gmail.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Shaun", "Grannis", email = "sgrannis@regenstrief.org", role = "aut"),
    person("J. Marc", "Overhage", email = "overhage@gmail.com", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Executes the distributed OHDSI network study pipeline for large-scale
  clinical concept association mining (Concept AB Mining Engine v57). Computes
  encounter-level and population-level co-occurrence statistics across OMOP CDM standard
  clinical domains (Condition, Drug, Measurement, Procedure, Device, Observation)
  partitioned into random batches to optimize memory and disk utilization. Evaluates
  temporal precedence, crude and healthcare utilization-stratified lift, odds ratios,
  and continuity-corrected directionality ratios with complete privacy preservation and
  zero patient-level data export.
